<title>UK: FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Consensus on UK company results.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysts' estimates of UK company results expected in week ending October 18 include -</p>
<p>COMPANY----------------PFT/DIV/EPS--CONSENSUS----RANGE-------PVS</p>
<p>MONDAY, October 14</p>
<p>Highland	F	     PFT	  41.0	39.2-42.5    42.9</p>
<p>Distilleries		  DIV	   8.3	 8.3-8.7	7.9</p>
<p>				  EPS	  21.6	20.8-22.3    22.1</p>
<p>Premier	 I	     PFT	  61.6	57.5-63.1    36.0</p>
<p>Farnell			 DIV	   5.0	 5.0-5.5	4.6</p>
<p>				  EPS	  16.3	12.9-16.3    17.9</p>
<p>TUESDAY, October 15</p>
<p>- no major companies reporting</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, October 16</p>
<p>Smiths	  F	     PFT	162.8	159.0-165.0  138.0</p>
<p>Industries		    DIV	 16.0	 15.7-16.0    14.4</p>
<p>				  EPS	 36.3	 34.6-37.4    30.7</p>
<p>THURSDAY, October 17</p>
<p>- no major companies reporting</p>
<p>FRIDAY, October 18</p>
<p>- no major companies reporting</p>
<p>NOTES</p>
<p>** Premier Farnell's previous profit figure is not directly comparable with the forecasts. It refers to Farnell Electronics, which merged with the U.S. group Premier Industrial Corp to form Premier Farnell earlier this year.</p>
<p>All profit figures are pretax, exclude exceptional items unless otherwise stated and are in millions stg. Dividends are total net and quoted as pence per share.</p>
<p>John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
